WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.900
How does it feel when a busy week
makes you forget to eat?

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.400
Or when the systems meant to help you
fall apart?

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.400
When you know what to do,
but can't do it?

4
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.600
Hi, I'm Filippo, and I have ADHD.

5
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.800
For years I've used off-the-shelf tools
that required my constant attention.

6
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.500
In the end, they needed me
more than I needed them.

7
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:35.600
And now I use AI to build solutions
that take that friction away.

8
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.200
Does this sound like the help you want?

9
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.800
We can work together for an hour
to get you unstuck,

10
00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.800
or I can quote for building
a solution for you.

11
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.600
Either way, I'm looking forward
to hearing from you.
